@title S2 EP 05 • FIGHTS THAT TURN INTO SILENCE
@bg locker_room_day
Saturday. Home opener vs Eastbrook. The locker room is dead silent. Nobody's speaking to anybody.
@show nicole
Nicole: Okay. I'm captain, so I'm saying it. This team is a disaster. Nicole and Valentina aren't talking. Chloe and Maya aren't talking. Jordan and Brooke are—
@show jordan
Jordan: Done. Officially. For real this time.
@show brooke
Brooke: You've said that nine times.
Jordan: Then this is ten. Write it down, Maya.
@show maya
Maya: (already writing) Ten.
@if Brooke_Has_Photo 1 photo
@jump nophoto
*photo
@show brooke
Brooke: (standing up) Actually, since we're all being HONEST today—
She holds up her phone. The photo. Riley on the counter. Tyler.
@show riley
Riley: Brooke, don't—
Brooke: Somebody on this team has been sneaking around with MY—
@show jordan
Jordan: YOUR? He's not yours! You were with ME four days before you were with him!
The whole room explodes.
> [Bold] Stand on the bench. "We have a GAME in twenty minutes!" -> f1
> [Sweet] Stand next to Riley. Hold her hand. -> f2
> [Bitchy] "Brooke, nobody wants Tyler. Including you." -> f3
> [Good] Go get Coach. -> f4
*f1
@add Team_Respect 3
@add Nicole_Friendship 2
Everyone stops. Even Brooke. Nicole looks at you like she's seeing her replacement.
Nicole: (quietly) ...She's right. Game faces. We'll kill each other after.
@jump f_done
*f2
@add Riley_Friendship 4
@add Nia_Friendship 2
@show nia
Nia walks over and stands on Riley's other side. Doesn't say anything. Doesn't have to. Riley looks at Nia, and for the first time realizes Nia was never trying to control her. She was just hurt.
@jump f_done
*f3
@add Brooke_Friendship -3
@add Jordan_Friendship 2
@add Drama 2
Brooke: (very calm) Okay. Okay, Sasha. You wanna play? Let's play.
She's going to get you back. Probably with a group-chat roast so good it gets pinned.
@add Brooke_Grudge 3
@jump f_done
*f4
@add Team_Respect -1
Coach benches Brooke and Riley for the first half. Nobody's happy. Everybody blames you a little.
*f_done
@jump game
*nophoto
Nobody looks at anybody. You can feel it, though: one secret away from all of it blowing up.
*game
@bg soccer_pitch_day
Game time. 1-1 in the 88th minute. Free kick, just outside the box. Nicole and Valentina both walk up to take it.
@show nicole
Nicole: Captain's kick.
@show valentina
Valentina: I'm the striker, Nicole. Scoring is literally my whole job.
They both look at you. You're the center mid. You're supposed to decide.
> [Good] Give it to Nicole. -> k1
> [Bold] Give it to Valentina. -> k2
> [Sweet] "Do it together. Nicole touches, Valentina shoots." -> k3
> [Bitchy] "Neither. I'll take it." -> k4
*k1
@add Nicole_Friendship 3
@add Valentina_Friendship -3
Nicole hits the crossbar. The ball goes out. It ends 1-1. Valentina doesn't say a word to anyone on the bus.
@jump k_done
*k2
@add Valentina_Friendship 3
@add Nicole_Friendship -3
Valentina curls it into the top corner. 2-1. She runs straight past Nicole to celebrate with you. Nicole's face is stone.
@jump k_done
*k3
@add Nicole_Friendship 3
@add Valentina_Friendship 3
@add Team_Respect 3
Nicole taps it sideways. Valentina blasts it. 2-1. And for one second, the two of them hug like the last six months never happened.
@jump k_done
*k4
@add Team_Respect 2
@add Nicole_Friendship -2
@add Valentina_Friendship -2
You step over the ball. Deep breath. Bottom corner. 2-1, MVU.
The stands go crazy. Nicole and Valentina look at each other — and for once, they're on the same side: against you.
*k_done
@bg parking_lot_night
After the game. Everyone's in the parking lot. You're about to get in your car when your phone buzzes. Unknown number.
"I know why you really transferred, Sasha. We should talk before the rest of the team figures it out."
@show maya
You look up. Maya's across the lot, looking at her phone. Chloe's next to her. Brooke's by her car. Every single one of them is looking at their phone.
End of Episode 5. To be continued...
@load s2/ep06.mvs
